972121a3c62cdf2981bb35048d5f49dbaf3b22476170c6cd4c5ce46da17919878726b5ff4796ff8917ba15c73da6a253647b6496c260bc09d0df56ab0485ebb3  0001-render-skip-surfaces-that-have-no-texture.patch
"
